  "ingredients": [
    "4 pounds medium pears, quartered and cored",
    "1/2 cup cold water, or as needed",
    "2 cups sugar",
    "1 teaspoon grated orange zest",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground nutmeg",
    "0.25 cup orange juice"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tqiSN7oU_zXNJkxB6q4Upo3yrVE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/75545-pear-butter-ddmfs-01-10911-977528e7c447455e941003d5ba0f7569.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/75545/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place pears into a large pot over medium heat; add just enough water to cover the bottom of the pot and keep them from sticking, about 1/2 cup. Cook until the pears are soft, about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YeqU2-e5oMkxDVBEu3ZzdKQUacY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/75545-pear-butter-ddmfs-02-10921-cec586a9884e40d1946145bf747ffac1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/75545/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Press pears through a sieve or food mill, and measure out 2 quarts of the pulp.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NsLOloWlPYRTk_Ir1B-vPBcv1hw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/75545-pear-butter-ddmfs-03-10928-15266ed1f795407f82c4c2137131b70d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/75545/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour pear pulp and sugar into a large saucepan and stir to dissolve sugar. Stir in orange zest, nutmeg, and orange juice. Cook over medium heat until mixture is thick enough to mound in a spoon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BmUlH6SW7WBkUgYB_SAkx_UYiss=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/75545-pear-butter-ddmfs-04-10932-b7f48612e9d9403d98a1350e3e40732a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/75545/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "When mixture begins to thicken, stir frequently to prevent scorching on the bottom. This process will take about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SI-I6NHVKYO5xMMwTjgmcNzDxRM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/75545-pear-butter-ddmfs-05-11103-f8c2ccee9461449e806063ba1ea358c4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/75545/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ladle pear butter into hot sterile jars, leaving 1/4 inch of headspace. Remove air bubbles by sliding a metal spatula around where the pear butter touches the glass. Wipe jar rims clean, and seal with lids and rings.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BR3zdY0j9BMiqRNqg2h5uVFXTak=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/75545-pear-butter-ddmfs-06-11106-fef55401506c4f18919d992cdd37dbf9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/75545/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Process for 10 minutes in a boiling water bath. The water should cover the jars by 1 inch. Check with your local extension for exact processing times for your area.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VmYtKXXhe3WCyozG_7QLuPCqtr4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/75545-pear-butter-ddmfs-07-11136-7ef4552934db48139a287acdbb1eff4e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/75545/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pibhfl26B3ymYKHKfsQStoSyqQo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/75545-pear-butter-ddmfs-08-11196-a516e019585b4f128181d851ab12e615.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/75545/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
